{# Every NEWS digest ever drafted, newest first, grouped by desk so the products do not
   interleave. Held ones are marked: a reader asking "why did this never arrive" gets the answer
   here rather than from the outbox table.

   The humour desks are excluded (_data/humour.js), because this page groups by NEWSROOM and the
   joke desk shares `nord-norge` with the news desk -- so a brief of 39 jokes listed here appeared
   under "Northern Norway" with nothing to mark it as jokes. The satire desk, in a newsroom of its
   own, had been getting its own heading; it is excluded on the same rule rather than on where it
   happens to sit. Both sections carry the briefs, with their disclaimers: /satire/ and /comedy/. #}
{% set news = reports | withoutAny("product", humour.products) %}
<p class="sub">{{ news | length }} {{ site.t.briefs[0] | lower }}
<span class="alt">{{ news | length }} {{ site.t.briefs[1] | lower }}</span></p>

{% for desk in desks %}
  {% set mine = news | where("newsroom", desk.id) %}
  {% if mine | length %}
  <h2 class="day">{{ desk.name[0] }} / {{ desk.name[1] }} · {{ mine | length }}</h2>
  <ul class="browse briefs">
  {% for r in mine %}
    <li><a href="{{ linkBase }}digest/{{ r.slug }}/">
      <span>{{ r.headline_en or r.headline }}
        {%- if r.warn | length %} <span class="chip warn" title="ethics flags">{{ r.warn | length }} {{ site.t.flagsWord[0] }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="n">{{ r.day }} · {{ r.stories | length }}</span></a></li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
